description:
Design a circuit that counts the number of high bits (1s) in a 16-bit input vector. The module latches the input value on the positive edge of a clock and subsequently counts the number of bits set to 1 in the latched value, outputting this count as a 4-bit wide value.
module top_module(
    input clk,            // Added clk input
    input [15:0] in,
    output reg [3:0] count
);

